{"4992150": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Plink Void", "steam_appid": 4992150, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [5108940], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Plink Void </strong>is a pachinko roguelike with a dark fantasy atmosphere. Throw blade-balls, collect game-changing artifacts, and reach the Void.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4992150/extras/ff759cc26d9a7c1891b9d9c74ccd0795.poster.avif?t=1786701780\" width=616 height=176 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4992150/extras/ff759cc26d9a7c1891b9d9c74ccd0795.webm?t=1786701780\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4992150/extras/ff759cc26d9a7c1891b9d9c74ccd0795.mp4?t=1786701780\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Sir Tarn, by the King's order, sets out in<strong> </strong>search of the Truth from which the world emanates. The Truth must defeat all violence, injustice, and suffering of this world. On a hard path, he will face both enemies and allies to reach the Void and find the Truth.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4992150/extras/c7834ccf57fbbdce09f81034f29b3983.poster.avif?t=1786701780\" width=346 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4992150/extras/c7834ccf57fbbdce09f81034f29b3983.webm?t=1786701780\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4992150/extras/c7834ccf57fbbdce09f81034f29b3983.mp4?t=1786701780\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Plink Void</strong> mixes plinko/pachinko with roguelike progression. Throw different blade-balls and smash skull-pegs with them. Smashing pegs stacks damage against the enemy. From time to time, you’ll encounter artifacts with special properties that add new mechanics to your balls.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >In <strong>Plink Void</strong> you will find:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arcade plinko gameplay with artifact-driven builds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Surreal enemies - creatures of weird lands</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dark fantasy aesthetics mixed with retro low-poly PSX</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A grim tale of seeking a world woefully lost</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Plink Void </strong>is a pachinko roguelike with a dark fantasy atmosphere. Throw blade-balls, collect game-changing artifacts, and reach the Void.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4992150/extras/ff759cc26d9a7c1891b9d9c74ccd0795.poster.avif?t=1786701780\" width=616 height=176 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4992150/extras/ff759cc26d9a7c1891b9d9c74ccd0795.webm?t=1786701780\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4992150/extras/ff759cc26d9a7c1891b9d9c74ccd0795.mp4?t=1786701780\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Sir Tarn, by the King's order, sets out in<strong> </strong>search of the Truth from which the world emanates. The Truth must defeat all violence, injustice, and suffering of 